a natural and immersive learning experience while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Mixed Reality-based CPR training\n\u2022 AED education and emergency response training\n\u2022 Seamless integration of virtual training content with the real environment\n\u2022 Intuitive hand-based interaction\n\u2022 Designed for schools, hospitals, emergency services, and corporate safety training\n\u2022 Repeatable training sessions that enhance learning effectiveness\n\nReaLive MR enhances conventional CPR education by providing a safe, immersive, and highly interactive training environment that helps learners develop practical life-saving skills and emergency response capabilities.\n\nDeveloped by TechSan Co., Ltd., ReaLive MR combines advanced Mixed Reality technology with immersive CPR education to deliver realistic and effective emergency response training.", "short_description": "ReaLive MR is a Mixed Reality CPR training solution that enables immersive CPR and AED education using Meta Quest devices."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ub85c\uace0_\uc228\ud130\uce58 1024_1024.png", "id": "1592341982239556", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1592341985572889_6947409751023236525_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkvv-5C4-O4Q7kNvwH0QXhE&_nc_oc=AdrfkdmNo6l-Og3Eerq04bW1NJH5WDn3L05LB9xJ1qugDH4t4kENF68-bG__EL5BPXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGFH7vhKVklzrSiTUQFFA4t8D9W0n9ABm9LS1KDxnnO5A&oe=6A79C8FF"}, {"file_name": "\uc228\ud130\uce58_\ub300\ud45c_3000x900_Safe area.png", "id": "1306835034770003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1306835038103336_6820841876092211466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VFY3E-VOk4EQ7kNvwEHTIeH&_nc_oc=Adp6yQrdDhKoXs9N35-A61YIHx-EdKuv5YM9GKQEOrNhLu7XLPQK4IH1WWjyoXoDpKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-